Value ID (\d+)
Value MAC_ADDRESS ([0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4}|[0-9a-fA-F:-]{12,17}|[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4})
Value VLAN_ID (\d+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value TYPE (\S+)
Value ACTION (\S+)

Start
  ^ID\s+MAC Address\s+VLAN ID\s+Ports\s+Type\s+Action
  ^${ID}\s+${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${VLAN_ID}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${TYPE}\s+${ACTION}\s*$$ -> Record
